@host = http://localhost:5044

### List
GET {{host}}/api/purchase-orders

### Create (supplier 1, warehouse 1, product 1)
POST {{host}}/api/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "supplierId": 1, "warehouseId": 1, "lines": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 12, "unitCost": 700 } ] }

### Receive too early (still DRAFT), expect 409
POST {{host}}/api/purchase-orders/2/receive

### Mark as ordered
POST {{host}}/api/purchase-orders/2/order

### Receive, expect { "linesReceived": 1 }
POST {{host}}/api/purchase-orders/2/receive

### Receive again, expect 409
POST {{host}}/api/purchase-orders/2/receive

### Unknown order, expect 404
POST {{host}}/api/purchase-orders/999/receive

### Empty lines, expect 400
POST {{host}}/api/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "supplierId": 1, "warehouseId": 1, "lines": [] }